#: main.gd HELP
msgid "Fighting"
msgstr ""

#: main.gd HELP
msgid "4 6 walk, 8 jump (with 4/6 to leap), 2 crouch, 0 run away  (A D W S Q)\nZ attack, X defend, C command mode (items)\ngamepad: X attack, Y defend, Back command, LB run away; in menus d-pad, A select, B cancel"
msgstr ""

#: main.gd HELP
msgid "Typing"
msgstr ""

#: main.gd HELP
msgid "names end with Space; Right types a space.\nTo talk to people, type a word to ask about: in a translation plain words work (in English e.g. drug, FRD, password, a monster's name).  In Japanese mode they only understand katakana: press ` (or the KANA button) and type romaji, e.g. doraggu gives ﾄﾞﾗｯｸﾞ.\nWith a gamepad, an on-screen keyboard comes up (also the Keyboard button): A types, B deletes, X space, LB/RB page (ABC, abc, katakana), Start OK."
msgstr ""

#: main.gd HELP
msgid "Port"
msgstr ""

#: main.gd HELP
msgid "F6 quick save (in the town's menu or standing in BIAS),  F7 quick load\nF8 or M map of the floor (in BIAS; gamepad R3),  J journal (gamepad L3),  F9 fast-forward (RT)\nF10 / Start settings: language, font, display, sound, accessibility, saves, controls, roster\nF11 full screen,  F12 this help\nSaving, and going back a few steps on death: the Modern difficulty (settings: Game; Original plays as in 1985).\nOn a touch screen, touch it: buttons come up beside the picture (settings: Access)."
msgstr ""

